bnail": null, "display_name": "\u795e\u7bad\u624b\u5854\u9632", "keywords": ["\u5854\u9632", "\u7b56\u7565", "3D", "\u5c04\u7bad"], "long_description": "\u83ab\u540d\u51fa\u73b0\u7684\u4f20\u9001\u95e8\uff0c\u541e\u566c\u4e86\u5468\u8fb9\u7684\u8349\u6728\uff0c\u4ece\u95e8\u4e2d\u6d8c\u51fa\u8bb8\u591a\u88ab\u611f\u67d3\u7684\u9ab7\u9ac5\u548c\u602a\u7269\uff0c\u5b83\u4eec\u653b\u51fb\u7684\u76ee\u6807\u662f\u5c9b\u5c7f\u4e0a\u7684\u201c\u5b88\u62a4\u77f3\u7891\u201d\uff0c\u4e00\u65e6\u77f3\u7891\u88ab\u6467\u6bc1\uff0c\u5c9b\u5c7f\u5c06\u5b8c\u5168\u88ab\u761f\u75ab\u7b3c\u7f69\u3002\n\n       \u761f\u75ab\u8fc4\u4eca\u4e3a\u6b62\u5df2\u7ecf\u4fb5\u8680\u4e86\u6570\u5ea7\u5c9b\u5c7f\uff0c\u800c\u4e14\u8fd8\u5728\u4e0d\u65ad\u5411\u5916\u6269\u5f20\u3002\u6b64\u65f6\u8fb9\u5883\u6751\u5e84\u7a7f\u6765\u6c42\u6551\u4fe1\u53f7\uff0c\u761f\u75ab\u4f20\u9001\u95e8\u5df2\u7ecf\u6253\u5f00\uff0c\u968f\u65f6\u53ef\u80fd\u6709\u611f\u67d3\u8005\u5165\u4fb5\uff0c\u6751\u5e84\u5185\u7684\u5b88\u62a4\u4e4b\u7891\u9700\u8981\u4f60\u7684\u5b88\u62a4\u3002\n\n       \u4f60\u5c06\u626e\u6f14\u5c9b\u4e0a\u7684\u9b54\u5854\u9632\u5fa1\u8005\uff0c\u4f7f\u7528\u5f13\u7bad\u548c\u9b54\u6cd5\u6c99\u76d8\u62b5\u5fa1\u654c\u4eba\u7684\u5165\u4fb5\u3002\n\n# \u9b54\u6cd5\u6c99\u76d8\uff0c\u865a\u5b9e\u4ea4\u7ec7\n\n       \u638c\u63a7\u4e00\u9762\u795e\u79d8\u7684\u6218\u7565\u6c99\u76d8\uff0c\u4f60\u5728\u6b64\u5904\u7684\u6bcf\u4e00\u6b21\u5e03\u5c40\u548c\u63a8\u6f14\uff0c\u90fd\u80fd\u5b9e\u65f6\u6620\u5c04\u5e76\u5f71\u54cd\u524d\u65b9\u7684\u6e38\u620f\u4e16\u754c\uff0c\u4eff\u4f5b\u62e5\u6709\u64cd\u63a7\u73b0\u5b9e\u7684\u9b54\u529b\u3002\u73a9\u5bb6\u53ef\u4ee5\u5728\u4e0e\u5730\u56fe\u4e00\u6bd4\u4e00\u5bf9\u5e94\u7684\u9b54\u6cd5\u6c99\u76d8\u4e0a\u653e\u7f6e\u9632\u5fa1\u5854\uff0c\u6b64\u65f6\u5bf9\u5e94\u6c99\u76d8\u4e0a\u7684\u73b0\u5b9e\u4e16\u754c\u5c31\u4f1a\u5347\u8d77\u540c\u6837\u7684\u9632\u5fa1\u5854\uff0c\u4f7f\u7528\u5404\u79cd\u9632\u5fa1\u5854\u963b\u6321\u654c\u4eba\u7684\u8fdb\u653b\u3002\n{2350161342083883}\n\n# \u53cc\u7ebf\u4f5c\u6218\uff0c\u7b56\u7565\u6fc0\u8361\u200b\u200b \n\n       \u4e0d\u4ec5\u9700\u8981\u8fd0\u7b79\u5e37\u5e44\uff0c\u7cbe\u5fc3\u5e03\u9632\u5404\u5f0f\u7bad\u5854\u4e0e\u5de5\u4e8b\uff1b\u66f4\u80fd\u4eb2\u81ea\u633d\u5f13\u642d\u7bad\uff0c\u4ee5\u7cbe\u51c6\u7684\u5c04\u51fb\u5316\u89e3\u5371\u673a\uff0c\u4eab\u53d7\u7b56\u7565\u5e03\u5c40\u4e0e\u52a8\u4f5c\u64cd\u4f5c\u7684\u53cc\u91cd\u4e50\u8da3\u3002\n{3190629341088323}\n\n# \u81ea\u7531\u9776\u573a\uff0c\u968f\u5fc3\u6240\u6b32\u200b\u200b\n\n       \u9776\u573a\u4e0d\u4ec5\u662f\u78e8\u783a\u7bad\u672f\u3001\u8bd5\u70bc\u65b0\u6b66\u5668\u7684\u8bad\u7ec3\u8425\uff0c\u66f4\u662f\u4e00\u4e2a\u53ef\u4ee5\u81ea\u7531\u79fb\u52a8\u3001\u63a2\u7d22\u548c\u53d1\u73b0\u60ca\u559c\u7684\u5b89\u5168\u7a7a\u95f4\uff0c\u4e3a\u7d27\u5f20\u7684\u6218\u4e8b\u63d0\u4f9b\u4e00\u7247\u653e\u677e\u4e4b\u5730\u3002\n{1450058262711852}\n\n# \u73a9\u5bb6\u6307\u6325\u5ba4\uff0c\u8fd0\u7b79\u5e37\u5e44\u200b\u200b \n\n       \u8fd9\u91cc\u662f\u4f60\u7684\u6218\u7565\u6838\u5fc3\uff01\u4e0d\u4ec5\u53ef\u4ee5\u914d\u7f6e\u5347\u7ea7\u88c5\u5907\u6b66\u5668\u3001\u8d2d\u4e70\u7a00\u7f3a\u8d44\u6e90\uff0c\u66f4\u80fd\u81ea\u7531\u6d3b\u52a8\u3002\u6e38\u620f\u4e2d\u89e3\u9501\u7684\u6210\u5c31\u5956\u676f\u5c06\u5728\u6b64\u5904\u9648\u5217\uff0c\u8bb0\u5f55\u7740\u4f60\u7684\u6e38\u620f\u751f\u6daf\u3002\n\n\n{1872464480034375}", "short_description": "\u795e\u79d8\u4f20\u9001\u95e8\u7a81\u5140\u964d\u4e34\uff0c\u4e3a\u5c9b\u5c7f\u5e26\u6765\u88ab\u761f\u75ab\u611f\u67d3\u7684\u602a\u7269\u3002\u5b83\u4eec\u5984\u56fe\u6467\u6bc1 \u201c\u5b88\u62a4\u77f3\u7891\u201d\uff0c\u4e00\u65e6\u5f97\u901e\uff0c\u5c9b\u5c7f\u5c06\u88ab\u761f\u75ab\u5168\u9762\u7b3c\u7f69\u3002\u73a9\u5bb6\u9700\u626e\u6f14\u5c9b\u4e0a\u9632\u5fa1\u8005\uff0c\u501f\u52a9\u5f13\u7bad\u8f85\u52a9\u653b\u51fb\uff0c\u5229\u7528\u9b54\u6cd5\u6c99\u76d8\u653e\u7f6e\u9632\u5fa1\u5854\uff0c\u963b\u6321\u602a\u7269\u8fdb\u653b\u3002"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.dejevis.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Developer Dashboard, OVR Metrics Tool", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.dejevis.com/sjsyxjs", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "zh_CN"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24036401626019235"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2110559080345334"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1380573240096087"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "747354331468516"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2110559080345334"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1793116800, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2110559080345334"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "29094775006848513", "version": "2.0.1"}, "id": "690412057133487", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24036401589352572", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29094775006848513"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "690412057133487"}]}, "change_log": "This update brings a brand-new Mixed Reality experience, new chapters, weapons, and enemies!\r\n\r\nNew Mixed Reality (MR) Mode: Bring the magical tabletop battlefield into your real-world surroundings and turn your room into a command center!\r\n\r\nTwo New Chapters: Explore brand-new Autumn and Winter battlefields, featuring new environments, levels, and challenges.\r\n\r\nNew Bows: Unlock new bows and experience different shooting effects and combat styles.\r\n\r\nNew Enemies: Face new types of monsters and take on fresh challenges across the battlefield.\r\n\r\nEnter the new battlefields, take up your bow, and continue defending the island!", "created_date": 1793106680, "id": "29094775006848513", "version": "2.0.1", "version_code": 4, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24036401589352572", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29094775006848513"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "690412057133487"}]}, "change_log": "Dear Meta Review Team,\n\nWe have addressed the issues related to crystal quantity, achievements, and menu interface in the old version of the game, and have completed updates and fixes for 4-5 bugs.\n\nWe kindly request your prompt review and approval.\n\nThank you for your time and effort!\n\nSincerely,\n\nDejevis", "created_date": 1758122572, "id": "24728167343509323", "version": "0.0.29", "version_code": 3, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24036401589352572", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29094775006848513"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "690412057133487"}]}, "change_log": "The six core highlights of Divine Archer Tower Defense will take you into a fantasy world where strategy and action intertwine:\n\n1. Magical Sand Table: Intertwining Virtual and Real\nTake control of a mysterious strategic sand table. Every layout and deduction you make here can be mapped in real time and affect the in-game world ahead, as if you possess the magic to manipulate reality. Players can place defense towers on the magical sand table, which corresponds to the in-game map on a 1:1 scale. At the same time, identical defense towers will rise in the real-world scene corresponding to the sand table, and you can use various defense towers to block the enemy's attack.\n\n2. Dual-Front Combat: Stirring Strategy\nYou not only need to make overall plans and carefully arrange various arrow towers and fortifications; you can also personally draw the bow and shoot arrows, resolving crises with precise shots, and enjoying the dual fun of strategic layout and action operations.\n\n3. Power of Creation: Crafted by You\nFrom editing the map with every blade of grass and every tree to designing the level events wave by wave, powerful creation tools are in your hands. Create a unique battlefield and invite friends to challenge your masterpiece. The desktop version of the game allows players to customize maps and levels, letting you build a battlefield of your own.\n\n4. Multi-Platform Immersion: Seamless Cross-Border Gameplay\nThe game supports two gameplay modes: traditional PC desktop and VR. This allows you to either make strategies in a comfortable setting or step into the battlefield as if you were really there, fully experiencing the thrill of defending and drawing the bow to shoot arrows.\n\n5. Free Shooting Range: Do as You Wish\nThe shooting range is not only a training camp for honing your archery skills and testing new weapons, but also a safe space where you can move freely, explore, and discover surprises\u2014providing a place to relax amid the intense battles.\n\n6. Player Command Room: Masterminding Strategies\nThis is your strategic core! Here, you can not only configure and upgrade equipment and weapons, and purchase scarce resources, but also move freely. The achievement trophies unlocked in the game will be displayed here, recording your gaming career.", "created_date": 1758017145, "id": "24718339541158770", "version": "0.0.28", "version_code": 2, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24036401589352572", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29094775006848513"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "690412057133487"}]}, "change_log": "The six core highlights of Divine Archer Tower Defense will take you into a fantasy world where strategy and action intertwine:\n\n1. Magical Sand Table: Intertwining Virtual and Real\nTake control of a mysterious strategic sand table. Every layout and deduction you make here can be mapped in real time and affect the in-game world ahead, as if you possess the magic to manipulate reality. Players can place defense towers on the magical sand table, which corresponds to the in-game map on a 1:1 scale. At the same time, identical defense towers will rise in the real-world scene corresponding to the sand table, and you can use various defense towers to block the enemy's attack.\n\n2. Dual-Front Combat: Stirring Strategy\nYou not only need to make overall plans and carefully arrange various arrow towers and fortifications; you can also personally draw the bow and shoot arrows, resolving crises with precise shots, and enjoying the dual fun of strategic layout and action operations.\n\n3. Power of Creation: Crafted by You\nFrom editing the map with every blade of grass and every tree to designing the level events wave by wave, powerful creation tools are in your hands. Create a unique battlefield and invite friends to challenge your masterpiece. The desktop version of the game allows players to customize maps and levels, letting you build a battlefield of your own.\n\n4. Multi-Platform Immersion: Seamless Cross-Border Gameplay\nThe game supports two gameplay modes: traditional PC desktop and VR. This allows you to either make strategies in a comfortable setting or step into the battlefield as if you were really there, fully experiencing the thrill of defending and drawing the bow to shoot arrows.\n\n5. Free Shooting Range: Do as You Wish\nThe shooting range is not only a training camp for honing your archery skills and testing new weapons, but also a safe space where you can move freely, explore, and discover surprises\u2014providing a place to relax amid the intense battles.\n\n6. Player Command Room: Masterminding Strategies\nThis is your strategic core! Here, you can not only configure and upgrade equipment and weapons, and purchase scarce resources, but also move freely. The achievement trophies unlocked in the game will be displayed here, recording your gaming career.", "created_date": 1757703901, "id": "24690312267294831", "version": "0.0.1", "version_code": 1, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}